        </zone>
        <zone h='94124' hidden-by-user='true' id='315' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='86735' x='13145' y='2880'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2420' hidden-by-user='true' id='316' type-v2='text' w='86615' x='13205' y='2995'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#2b5c8a' fontsize='7' italic='true'>Follow us on Youtube for latest Accelerator videos: @TableauAccelerators </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='32834' hidden-by-user='true' id='331' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='86615' x='13205' y='5415'>
            <zone fixed-size='757' forceUpdate='true' h='32834' hidden-by-user='true' id='333' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='45918' x='13205' y='5415'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#2b5c8a' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='12'>WEIGHTED SALES PIPELINE</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>Sales Pipeline is the process by which an organization converts its sales opportunities (or leads) into sales.</run>
                <run>

The Tableau Accelerator allows you to:
     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Conduct overall sales pipeline review</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Assess and improve your sales performance</run>
                <run>: 
               - Pipeline generation
               - Ability to convert opportunities
     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Understand &amp; grow each opportunity owner&apos;s profile (based on profiling  &amp; recommended trainings)</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Breakdown your pipeline at any level of detail</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Focus your efforts on areas with best conversion</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Assess performance improvements over time</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Drill-back at Opportunity level of detail, directly in your Sales Pipeline Application and take immediate actions</run>
                <run>

Compared to a standard Pipeline, a Weighted Pipeline introduces the concept of &quot;Probability of Closing&quot; (expressed in %) for each opportunity, which allows a more accurate and realistic analysis of the pipeline.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='32834' hidden-by-user='true' id='332' type-v2='text' w='40697' x='59123' y='5415'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2b5c8a' fontsize='10'>Answer key business questions</run>
                <run>
     - What is the size of our sales pipeline: overdue, short, medium, and long term?
     - What was our ability to convert opportunities?
     - Which opportunities do we have in our sales pipeline? Which opportunities do we win the most?
     - How is our sales pipeline composed?
     - Which account(s) drive our ability to convert opportunities?</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone h='46083' hidden-by-user='true' id='328' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='86615' x='13205' y='38249'>
            <zone fixed-size='757' forceUpdate='true' h='46083' hidden-by-user='true' id='329' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='45918' x='13205' y='38249'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2b5c8a' fontsize='10'>Monitor and improve KPIs</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;  </run>
                <run fontcolor='#2b5c8a' italic='true' underline='true'>Open opportunities</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Pipeline Value</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_NbOpenOpportunities_Description (copy)_1452692401309917187]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Weighted Pipeline Value</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_PipelineValue_Description (copy)_1452692401310101509]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Nb of Open Opportunities</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[Last x Days (copy)_1452692401309581312]>
  ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#2b5c8a' italic='true' underline='true'>All opportunities</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Total Closed Opportunities Amount</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_NbClosedOpportunities_Description (copy)_1358679765460369411]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Nb of Opportunities</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_NbOpenOpportunities_Description (copy)_1358679765464379397]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Avg Opportunity Size</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_AvgDealSizeWon_Description (copy)_1307169844765896713]>
  ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#2b5c8a' italic='true' underline='true'>Closed opportunities</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Total Closed Opportunities Amount</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_NbClosedOpportunities_Description (copy)_1358679765460369411]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Total Sales</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_SalesCycle_Description (copy)_1452692401318907919]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Nb of Closed Opportunities</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_NbOpenOpportunities_Description (copy)_1358679765455953921]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Nb of Won Opportunities</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_NbOpenOpportunities_Description (copy)_1452692401358135316]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Nb of Lost Opportunities</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_NbWonOpportunities_Description (copy)_1307169844763209729]> 
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Sales Cycle</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_PipelineValue_Description (copy)_1452692401316077579]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Sales Cycle (won)</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_SalesCycle_Description (copy)_1307169844763766787]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Sales Cycle (lost)</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_SalesCycleWon_Description (copy)_1307169844764229637]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Avg Deal Size (won)</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_ConversionRate_Description (copy)_1452692401317089293]>
  ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#2b5c8a' italic='true' underline='true'>Performance</run>
                <run>&#10;     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Won/Lost Rate</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_PipelineValue_Description (copy)_1452692401310478343]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Conversion Rate</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_WonLostRate_Description (copy)_1452692401310605321]>
     - ]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Sales Velocity</run>
                <run><![CDATA[: <[Parameters].[KPI_ConversionRate_Description (copy)_1307169844772745227]>]]></run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='46083' hidden-by-user='true' id='330' type-v2='text' w='40697' x='59123' y='38249'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2b5c8a' fontsize='10'>Required attributes</run>
                <run>&#10;     -</run>
                <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' underline='true'>Opportunity Id</run>
                <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run>: Opportunity Unique Identifier
     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Account</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run>: Customer/Prospect name
     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Opportunity Owner</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run>: Owner of the opportunity
     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Opportunity Type</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run>: Type of Opportunity&#10;     -</run>
                <run bold='true'> Opportunity Description</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run>: Opportunity Description
     -</run>
                <run bold='true'> Opportunity Stage</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run>: Opportunity Stage (according to your standards)
     -</run>
                <run bold='true'> Open Flag</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run> ← expected values: &apos;Y&apos;, &apos;N&apos;. &apos;Y&apos; means the opportunity is Open.
     -</run>
                <run bold='true'> Won Flag</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(string)</run>
                <run> ← expected values: &apos;Y&apos;, &apos;N&apos;. &apos;Y&apos; means the opportunity is Closed and Won.
     -</run>
                <run bold='true'> Created Date</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(date)</run>
                <run>: Opportunity Creation Date
     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>(Estimated) Closed Date</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(date)</run>
                <run>: Actual Closed Date is the opportunity is Closed, else Estimated Close Date
     - </run>
                <run bold='true'>Amount</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(numeric)</run>
                <run>: Opportunity Amount&#10;     -</run>
                <run bold='true'> Probability %</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run italic='true'>(numeric)</run>
                <run>: Probability to win the opportunity (0.5 stands for 50%)</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#2b5c8a' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
